      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Low-level Al addition to a Cr coating will generate an ultra-thin, dense, stable Al2O3 scale at the Cr/Zr interface.",
