      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10972435::page::003"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "A dense alumina scale can provide high-temperature protection for an Al-containing metallic coating on zirconium cladding.",
